24
00:02:52,463 --> 00:02:54,507
Oh, my goodness, how could
I ever forget about you, Director Kim?

25
00:03:04,893 --> 00:03:06,394
Congratulations, Mayor,
I wish the best to you.

26
00:03:06,895 --> 00:03:07,896
Mm.

27
00:03:07,979 --> 00:03:08,980
Thank you.

28
