34
00:03:28,833 --> 00:03:31,669
Well, I have to say, it's all\
thanks to Director Kim and Chairman Gu.

35
00:03:31,753 --> 00:03:33,046
- Hey, pour me some, too.
- Sure.

36
00:03:34,547 --> 00:03:35,715
