- Hello.

38
00:03:39,093 --> 00:03:40,803
Chairman, I'm Kim Gwang-hyeon,
nice to meet you.

39
00:03:41,429 --> 00:03:44,098
Chairman, I'm Lee Gyeong-seok,
nice to meet you.

40
