internal medicine be better?

45
00:03:58,321 --> 00:04:00,907
Ugh, I didn't go to med school
just to care for you guys.

46
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:03,618
I understand. It was to be able
to inherit the hospital.

47
00:04:03,701 --> 00:04:05,828
Ugh. Just focus on the ball,
you little shit.

48
00:04:08,456 --> 00:04:10,458
Hmm-hmm.

49
00:04:11,167 --> 00:04:13,795
- What're you doing? Some kinda pervert?
- Oh, man, that hurts...

50
00:04:13,878 --> 00:04:16,714
Nah, I hit myself with the cue earlier.

51
