63
00:05:06,764 --> 00:05:08,433
Uh... yeah- okay. Uh, I- I'll pick him up.

64
00:05:08,516 --> 00:05:10,977
- It hurts!
- You're okay, you're okay.

65
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:13,021
It hurts.

