the patient needs an emergency operation.

75
00:05:41,549 --> 00:05:42,967
Aren't you a doctor?
I think you should come with us.

76
00:05:45,970 --> 00:05:47,972
Wait, I'm only an intern, I told you!

77
00:05:48,931 --> 00:05:50,266
Hey, wait! Wait a second.

78
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:54,020
What's your name?
Can you tell me who you are?

79
00:05:56,981 --> 00:05:59,776
<i>Together, we've weathered</i>
<i>the COVID-nineteen pandemic,</i>

80
00:05:59,859 --> 00:06:02,403
<i>the legislation mandating cameras</i>
<i>in operating rooms,</i>

81
00:06:02,487 --> 00:06:05,323
<i>and even the strike against</i>
<i>increasing medical school admissions.</i>

82
00:06:05,406 --> 00:06:09,285
We fought desperately through all of those
challenging, turbulent periods.

83
00:06:10,703 --> 00:06:12,121
But the crisis isn't over.

84
00:06:12,205 --> 00:06:13,956
Inside, we're battling the union.

85
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:16,292
Outside, changes to
the Medical Service Act.

86
00:06:16,376 --> 00:06:19,379
Meanwhile, doctors are called frauds
by a crooked media.

87
00:06:20,296 --> 00:06:22,465
Doctors must be protected
for healthcare to function.

88
00:06:22,548 --> 00:06:24,675
However, those-

89
00:06:28,262 --> 00:06:30,598
those dolts are just unable
to comprehend that.

90
00:06:31,307 --> 00:06:32,308
That's why, today...

91
00:06:33,684 --> 00:06:36,396
it's important that we at Magnolia
stand in complete harmony.

92
00:06:37,313 --> 00:06:39,399
Our fellow Magnolia member,
Im Ho-seok's election as mayor...

93
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,818
