94
00:06:53,955 --> 00:06:56,290
Let's hear it! Let's hear it! Yeah!

95
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,584
Alright, alright.

96
00:06:59,502 --> 00:07:00,795
I swear I will never forget where I began,

97
00:07:00,878 --> 00:07:02,880
you have my word,
I swear on my white coat.

98
00:07:03,506 --> 00:07:05,007
Nor will I ever forget Magnolia,

99
00:07:05,508 --> 00:07:08,428
and the support I was given by it,
in the journey toward where I am.

100
00:07:09,554 --> 00:07:10,596
And with that said...

101
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,557
Hear, hear! To the white coats!

102
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:13,933
To the white coats!

103
